<title>UK: SBC unit sets 150 mln Swiss franc convertible bond.</title>
<headline>SBC unit sets 150 mln Swiss franc convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following convertible bond was announced by lead manager Swiss Bank Corp.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWISS BANK CORP (JERSEYBRANCH)</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN SFR   COUPON     1.50	MATURITY    20.NOV.03</p>
<p> TYPE   CONVERTIBLE   ISS PRICE  100.875   PAY DATE    20.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING    EBS	 DENOMS (K) 10	  END OF SUB  25.OCT.96</p>
<p> CONVERSION PERIOD    20.NOV.96 - 06.NOV.03</p>
<p> NOTES	EACH BOND CAN BE CONVERTED INTO 2.1234 TIMES THE</p>
<p>		SMI CLOSE, WHERE ONE POINT CORRESPONDS TO ONE SWISS</p>
<p>		FRANC.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
